    ///
    /// HIS OWN 2-SIDED VAULT, MEASURED AND CROSS-CHECKED, TWO WAYS. The
    /// engine's own CapCrescents (read off the real Courses() call at his
    /// canvas settings) is checked against a SECOND, independent trace this
